        },
        {
          "text": "BWANA wawizerie wandu wake, “Ini namkunde matuku ghose.” Ela wandu wake wawuyaghamba, “Oho kwadikunde wada?” BWANA ukawitumbulia, “Welee, Esau nderekoghe mruna Jakobo? Ela sena ini neemkunda Jakobo,",
          "type": "text",
